{"seq":3,"slug":"game-and-creative","title":"游戏与创意应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/real-world-applications/game-and-creative","wordCount":854,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"游戏与创意应用\">游戏与创意应用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>游戏与创意应用是 WASM 的天然舞台，因为它们的负载高度集中在计算与图形。引擎侧，Unity/Unreal/Godot/Bevy 均可编译到 WASM + WebGL，把既有生态直接带到浏览器；音频侧，WASM 在 AudioWorklet 中做实时 DSP，要满足 2.9ms/128 采样的严苛延迟预算；物理侧，Rapier 等 Rust 引擎编译后体积仅约 200KB 便能提供高精度 2D/3D 模拟。工程上推荐<strong>WASM 负责计算、JS 负责渲染</strong>的分工，以尽量减少跨边界的 GL 调用；面向未来，WebGPU 将比 WebGL 带来更强的 GPU 计算能力。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"unity-unreal-wasm-导出\">Unity / Unreal WASM 导出</h2><p>主流游戏引擎支持将项目编译为 WASM，在浏览器中运行 3D 游戏和交互体验。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    UNITY[&quot;Unity 项目&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;WebGL Build&quot;| WASM_UNITY[&quot;WASM + WebGL&quot;]&#10;    UNREAL[&quot;Unreal 项目&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;HTML5 Platform&quot;| WASM_UNREAL[&quot;WASM + WebGL&quot;]&#10;    WASM_UNITY --&gt; BROWSER[&quot;浏览器&quot;]&#10;    WASM_UNREAL --&gt; BROWSER&#10;    BROWSER --&gt; WEBGL[&quot;WebGL 2.0 / WebGPU&quot;]&#10;    BROWSER --&gt; AUDIO_OUT[&quot;Web Audio API&quot;]&#10;    BROWSER --&gt; INPUT[&quot;输入事件&quot;]\">graph TD\n    UNITY[\"Unity 项目\"] --&gt;|\"WebGL Build\"| WASM_UNITY[\"WASM + WebGL\"]\n    UNREAL[\"Unreal 项目\"] --&gt;|\"HTML5 Platform\"| WASM_UNREAL[\"WASM + WebGL\"]\n    WASM_UNITY --&gt; BROWSER[\"浏览器\"]\n    WASM_UNREAL --&gt; BROWSER\n    BROWSER --&gt; WEBGL[\"WebGL 2.0 / WebGPU\"]\n    BROWSER --&gt; AUDIO_OUT[\"Web Audio API\"]\n    BROWSER --&gt; INPUT[\"输入事件\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引擎</th>\n<th>WASM 支持</th>\n<th>WebGL 版本</th>\n<th>典型输出大小</th>\n<th>压缩后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Unity</td>\n<td>✅ 官方支持</td>\n<td>WebGL 2.0</td>\n<td>10-50 MB</td>\n<td>3-15 MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unreal</td>\n<td>⚠️ 实验性</td>\n<td>WebGL 2.0</td>\n<td>50-200 MB</td>\n<td>15-60 MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Godot</td>\n<td>✅ 官方支持</td>\n<td>WebGL 2.0</td>\n<td>5-20 MB</td>\n<td>2-8 MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bevy (Rust)</td>\n<td>✅ 原生支持</td>\n<td>WebGL 2.0</td>\n<td>3-15 MB</td>\n<td>1-5 MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// Bevy 游戏引擎 WASM 示例&#10;use bevy::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    App::new()&#10;        .add_plugins(DefaultPlugins.set(WindowPlugin {&#10;            primary_window: Some(Window {&#10;                title: &quot;WASM 游戏&quot;.to_string(),&#10;                canvas: Some(&quot;#game-canvas&quot;.to_string()),&#10;                ..default()&#10;            }),&#10;            ..default()&#10;        }))&#10;        .add_systems(Startup, setup)&#10;        .add_systems(Update, (move_player, check_collisions))&#10;        .run();&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn setup(&#10;    mut commands: Commands,&#10;    mut meshes: ResMut&lt;Assets&lt;Mesh&gt;&gt;,&#10;    mut materials: ResMut&lt;Assets&lt;ColorMaterial&gt;&gt;,&#10;) {&#10;    commands.spawn(Camera2dBundle::default());&#10;    commands.spawn((&#10;        MaterialMesh2dBundle {&#10;            mesh: meshes.add(Circle::new(25.0)).into(),&#10;            material: materials.add(Color::srgb(0.2, 0.7, 0.9)),&#10;            ..default()&#10;        },&#10;        Player { speed: 200.0 },&#10;    ));&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[derive(Component)]&#10;struct Player {&#10;    speed: f32,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn move_player(&#10;    time: Res&lt;Time&gt;,&#10;    input: Res&lt;ButtonInput&lt;KeyCode&gt;&gt;,&#10;    mut query: Query&lt;(&amp;mut Transform, &amp;Player)&gt;,&#10;) {&#10;    for (mut transform, player) in &amp;mut query {&#10;        let mut direction = Vec3::ZERO;&#10;        if input.pressed(KeyCode::ArrowUp) { direction.y += 1.0; }&#10;        if input.pressed(KeyCode::ArrowDown) { direction.y -= 1.0; }&#10;        if input.pressed(KeyCode::ArrowLeft) { direction.x -= 1.0; }&#10;        if input.pressed(KeyCode::ArrowRight) { direction.x += 1.0; }&#10;        transform.translation += direction.normalize_or_zero()&#10;            * player.speed * time.delta_seconds();&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn check_collisions() {}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Bevy 游戏引擎 WASM 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use bevy::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    App::new()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .add_plugins(DefaultPlugins.set(WindowPlugin {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            primary_window: Some(Window {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                title: \"WASM 游戏\".to_string(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                canvas: Some(\"#game-canvas\".to_string()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ..default()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ..default()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .add_systems(Startup, setup)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .add_systems(Update, (move_player, check_collisions))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .run();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn setup(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mut commands: Commands,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mut meshes: ResMut&#x3C;Assets&#x3C;Mesh>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mut materials: ResMut&#x3C;Assets&#x3C;ColorMaterial>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    commands.spawn(Camera2dBundle::default());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    commands.spawn((</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        MaterialMesh2dBundle {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            mesh: meshes.add(Circle::new(25.0)).into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            material: materials.add(Color::srgb(0.2, 0.7, 0.9)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ..default()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Player { speed: 200.0 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Component)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Player {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    speed: f32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn move_player(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    time: Res&#x3C;Time>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input: Res&#x3C;ButtonInput&#x3C;KeyCode>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mut query: Query&#x3C;(&#x26;mut Transform, &#x26;Player)>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (mut transform, player) in &#x26;mut query {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut direction = Vec3::ZERO;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if input.pressed(KeyCode::ArrowUp) { direction.y += 1.0; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if input.pressed(KeyCode::ArrowDown) { direction.y -= 1.0; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if input.pressed(KeyCode::ArrowLeft) { direction.x -= 1.0; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if input.pressed(KeyCode::ArrowRight) { direction.x += 1.0; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        transform.translation += direction.normalize_or_zero()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            * player.speed * time.delta_seconds();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn check_collisions() {}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Unity WebGL 构建默认使用 Brotli 压缩，需要服务器支持 <code>Content-Encoding: br</code>。如果你的 CDN 不支持 Brotli，可以在 Build Settings 中切换到 Gzip。对于首次访问的用户，压缩算法对加载时间影响巨大。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"音频处理-dsp\">音频处理（DSP）</h2><p>WebAssembly 非常适合实时音频处理——每秒需要处理 44100 个采样点，延迟要求在毫秒级。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub struct AudioProcessor {&#10;    sample_rate: f32,&#10;    phase: f32,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;impl AudioProcessor {&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]&#10;    pub fn new(sample_rate: f32) -&gt; AudioProcessor {&#10;        AudioProcessor { sample_rate, phase: 0.0 }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn generate_sine(&amp;mut self, output: &amp;mut [f32], frequency: f32) {&#10;        let phase_inc = frequency / self.sample_rate;&#10;        for sample in output.iter_mut() {&#10;            *sample = (self.phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();&#10;            self.phase += phase_inc;&#10;            if self.phase &gt;= 1.0 { self.phase -= 1.0; }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn apply_lowpass(&amp;self, buffer: &amp;mut [f32], cutoff: f32) {&#10;        let rc = 1.0 / (cutoff * std::f32::consts::TAU);&#10;        let alpha = (1.0 / self.sample_rate) / (rc + 1.0 / self.sample_rate);&#10;        let mut prev = buffer[0];&#10;        for sample in buffer.iter_mut().skip(1) {&#10;            *sample = prev + alpha * (*sample - prev);&#10;            prev = *sample;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn apply_gain(buffer: &amp;mut [f32], gain: f32) {&#10;        for sample in buffer.iter_mut() {&#10;            *sample *= gain;&#10;            *sample = sample.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct AudioProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sample_rate: f32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    phase: f32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl AudioProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new(sample_rate: f32) -> AudioProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AudioProcessor { sample_rate, phase: 0.0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn generate_sine(&#x26;mut self, output: &#x26;mut [f32], frequency: f32) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let phase_inc = frequency / self.sample_rate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for sample in output.iter_mut() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            *sample = (self.phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            self.phase += phase_inc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if self.phase >= 1.0 { self.phase -= 1.0; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn apply_lowpass(&#x26;self, buffer: &#x26;mut [f32], cutoff: f32) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let rc = 1.0 / (cutoff * std::f32::consts::TAU);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let alpha = (1.0 / self.sample_rate) / (rc + 1.0 / self.sample_rate);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut prev = buffer[0];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for sample in buffer.iter_mut().skip(1) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            *sample = prev + alpha * (*sample - prev);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            prev = *sample;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn apply_gain(buffer: &#x26;mut [f32], gain: f32) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for sample in buffer.iter_mut() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            *sample *= gain;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            *sample = sample.clamp(-1.0, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class WasmAudioWorklet extends AudioWorkletProcessor {&#10;  private processor: AudioProcessor | null = null;&#10;&#10;  constructor() {&#10;    super();&#10;    this.port.onmessage = async (e) =&gt; {&#10;      if (e.data.type === &#39;init&#39;) {&#10;        const module = await import(&#39;./pkg/audio_wasm.js&#39;);&#10;        await module.default();&#10;        this.processor = new module.AudioProcessor(sampleRate);&#10;      }&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  process(inputs: Float32Array[][], outputs: Float32Array[][]): boolean {&#10;    if (!this.processor) return true;&#10;    const output = outputs[0][0];&#10;    this.processor.generate_sine(output, 440.0);&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WasmAudioWorklet</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioWorkletProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> processor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.port.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onmessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e.data.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'init'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> module</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pkg/audio_wasm.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.processor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AudioProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sampleRate);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inputs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">outputs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.processor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputs[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.processor.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">generate_sine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(output, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">440.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DSP 操作</th>\n<th>延迟预算</th>\n<th>WASM 适用性</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>波形生成</td>\n<td>&lt;5ms</td>\n<td>✅ 非常适合</td>\n<td>合成器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低通/高通滤波</td>\n<td>&lt;5ms</td>\n<td>✅ 非常适合</td>\n<td>均衡器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FFT 频谱分析</td>\n<td>&lt;10ms</td>\n<td>✅ 非常适合</td>\n<td>可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混响效果</td>\n<td>&lt;20ms</td>\n<td>✅ 适合</td>\n<td>空间效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间拉伸</td>\n<td>&lt;50ms</td>\n<td>✅ 适合</td>\n<td>音频编辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降噪</td>\n<td>&lt;100ms</td>\n<td>✅ 适合</td>\n<td>音频修复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    INPUT[&quot;音频输入&quot;] --&gt; WORKLET[&quot;AudioWorklet&lt;br/&gt;(WASM DSP)&quot;]&#10;    WORKLET --&gt; OUTPUT[&quot;音频输出&quot;]&#10;    WORKLET --&gt; ANALYZER[&quot;频谱分析&lt;br/&gt;(FFT WASM)&quot;]&#10;    ANALYZER --&gt; CANVAS[&quot;Canvas 可视化&quot;]\">graph LR\n    INPUT[\"音频输入\"] --&gt; WORKLET[\"AudioWorklet&lt;br/&gt;(WASM DSP)\"]\n    WORKLET --&gt; OUTPUT[\"音频输出\"]\n    WORKLET --&gt; ANALYZER[\"频谱分析&lt;br/&gt;(FFT WASM)\"]\n    ANALYZER --&gt; CANVAS[\"Canvas 可视化\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> AudioWorklet 运行在独立的音频线程中，有严格的实时性要求（128 采样 ≈ 2.9ms @44.1kHz）。在 Worklet 中加载 WASM 时，确保初始化在处理开始前完成，否则会出现音频卡顿。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"物理引擎\">物理引擎</h2><p>将成熟的物理引擎（如 Rapier、Box2D）编译到 WASM，在浏览器中实现高精度物理模拟。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use rapier2d::prelude::*;&#10;use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub struct PhysicsWorld {&#10;    pipeline: PhysicsPipeline,&#10;    gravity: Vector&lt;f32&gt;,&#10;    integration_params: IntegrationParameters,&#10;    islands: IslandManager,&#10;    broad_phase: DefaultBroadPhase,&#10;    narrow_phase: NarrowPhase,&#10;    bodies: RigidBodySet,&#10;    colliders: ColliderSet,&#10;    impulse_joints: ImpulseJointSet,&#10;    multibody_joints: MultibodyJointSet,&#10;    ccd_solver: CCDSolver,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;impl PhysicsWorld {&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]&#10;    pub fn new() -&gt; PhysicsWorld {&#10;        PhysicsWorld {&#10;            pipeline: PhysicsPipeline::new(),&#10;            gravity: vector![0.0, -9.81],&#10;            integration_params: IntegrationParameters::default(),&#10;            islands: IslandManager::new(),&#10;            broad_phase: DefaultBroadPhase::new(),&#10;            narrow_phase: NarrowPhase::new(),&#10;            bodies: RigidBodySet::new(),&#10;            colliders: ColliderSet::new(),&#10;            impulse_joints: ImpulseJointSet::new(),&#10;            multibody_joints: MultibodyJointSet::new(),&#10;            ccd_solver: CCDSolver::new(),&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn add_ball(&amp;mut self, x: f32, y: f32, radius: f32) -&gt; u32 {&#10;        let body = RigidBodyBuilder::dynamic().translation(vector![x, y]).build();&#10;        let handle = self.bodies.insert(body);&#10;        let collider = ColliderBuilder::ball(radius).restitution(0.7).build();&#10;        self.colliders.insert_with_parent(collider, handle, &amp;mut self.bodies);&#10;        handle.0.into_raw_parts().0&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use rapier2d::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct PhysicsWorld {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pipeline: PhysicsPipeline,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    gravity: Vector&#x3C;f32>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    integration_params: IntegrationParameters,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    islands: IslandManager,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    broad_phase: DefaultBroadPhase,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    narrow_phase: NarrowPhase,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bodies: RigidBodySet,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    colliders: ColliderSet,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    impulse_joints: ImpulseJointSet,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    multibody_joints: MultibodyJointSet,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ccd_solver: CCDSolver,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl PhysicsWorld {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new() -> PhysicsWorld {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PhysicsWorld {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            pipeline: PhysicsPipeline::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            gravity: vector![0.0, -9.81],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            integration_params: IntegrationParameters::default(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            islands: IslandManager::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            broad_phase: DefaultBroadPhase::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            narrow_phase: NarrowPhase::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            bodies: RigidBodySet::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            colliders: ColliderSet::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            impulse_joints: ImpulseJointSet::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            multibody_joints: MultibodyJointSet::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ccd_solver: CCDSolver::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn add_ball(&#x26;mut self, x: f32, y: f32, radius: f32) -> u32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let body = RigidBodyBuilder::dynamic().translation(vector![x, y]).build();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let handle = self.bodies.insert(body);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let collider = ColliderBuilder::ball(radius).restitution(0.7).build();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.colliders.insert_with_parent(collider, handle, &#x26;mut self.bodies);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handle.0.into_raw_parts().0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物理引擎</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>WASM 大小</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rapier</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>~200 KB</td>\n<td>2D/3D，高性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Box2D WASM</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n<td>~150 KB</td>\n<td>2D 经典引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cannon-es</td>\n<td>JS</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>3D，纯 JS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ammo.js</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n<td>~500 KB</td>\n<td>Bullet 物理移植</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"webgl-互操作\">WebGL 互操作</h2><p>WASM 模块可以通过 web-sys 直接调用 WebGL API，或通过 JS 层委托渲染。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph WASM 侧&#10;        GAME_LOGIC[&quot;游戏逻辑&quot;] --&gt; PHYSICS[&quot;物理模拟&quot;]&#10;        PHYSICS --&gt; RENDER_DATA[&quot;渲染数据&lt;br/&gt;(顶点/矩阵)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph JS 侧&#10;        RENDER_DATA --&gt;|&quot;共享内存&quot;| GL_CALLS[&quot;WebGL 调用&quot;]&#10;        GL_CALLS --&gt; GPU[&quot;GPU 渲染&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 替代方案&#10;        RENDER_DATA2[&quot;渲染数据&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;web-sys&quot;| WEB_SYS_GL[&quot;web-sys WebGL&quot;]&#10;        WEB_SYS_GL --&gt; GPU2[&quot;GPU 渲染&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph WASM 侧\n        GAME_LOGIC[\"游戏逻辑\"] --&gt; PHYSICS[\"物理模拟\"]\n        PHYSICS --&gt; RENDER_DATA[\"渲染数据&lt;br/&gt;(顶点/矩阵)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph JS 侧\n        RENDER_DATA --&gt;|\"共享内存\"| GL_CALLS[\"WebGL 调用\"]\n        GL_CALLS --&gt; GPU[\"GPU 渲染\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 替代方案\n        RENDER_DATA2[\"渲染数据\"] --&gt;|\"web-sys\"| WEB_SYS_GL[\"web-sys WebGL\"]\n        WEB_SYS_GL --&gt; GPU2[\"GPU 渲染\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渲染方式</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JS 层 WebGL</td>\n<td>✅ 好</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>简单渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>web-sys WebGL</td>\n<td>⚠️ 中等</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>纯 Rust 项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>wgpu（WebGPU）</td>\n<td>✅ 最佳</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>下一代图形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Canvas 2D</td>\n<td>⚠️ 一般</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>2D 简单场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 WASM 中通过 web-sys 调用 WebGL 有显著的跨边界开销（每次 GL 调用都是一次 JS↔WASM 交互）。对于 draw call 密集的场景，建议在 WASM 中计算渲染数据，在 JS 侧批量提交 GL 命令。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((游戏与创意))&#10;    游戏引擎&#10;      Unity/Unreal/Bevy&#10;      WebGL 2.0 渲染&#10;      压缩优化传输&#10;    音频 DSP&#10;      AudioWorklet&#10;      实时波形/滤波&#10;      毫秒级延迟&#10;    物理引擎&#10;      Rapier / Box2D&#10;      高精度模拟&#10;      200KB 体积&#10;    WebGL 互操作&#10;      共享内存传数据&#10;      批量 GL 调用&#10;      WebGPU 未来\">mindmap\n  root((游戏与创意))\n    游戏引擎\n      Unity/Unreal/Bevy\n      WebGL 2.0 渲染\n      压缩优化传输\n    音频 DSP\n      AudioWorklet\n      实时波形/滤波\n      毫秒级延迟\n    物理引擎\n      Rapier / Box2D\n      高精度模拟\n      200KB 体积\n    WebGL 互操作\n      共享内存传数据\n      批量 GL 调用\n      WebGPU 未来</pre><ul>\n<li>主流游戏引擎（<strong>Unity/Unreal/Godot/Bevy</strong>）均支持编译到 WASM + WebGL。</li>\n<li>WASM 在 <strong>AudioWorklet</strong> 中实现实时 DSP 处理，满足 2.9ms/128 采样的延迟预算。</li>\n<li><strong>Rapier</strong> 等 Rust 物理引擎编译到 WASM 后体积仅 ~200KB，提供高精度 2D/3D 模拟。</li>\n<li>WASM 与 WebGL 的互操作建议采用<strong>WASM 计算 + JS 渲染</strong>的分工模式，减少跨边界 GL 调用。</li>\n<li><strong>WebGPU</strong> 作为 WebGL 的继任者，将为 WASM 图形应用带来更强大的 GPU 计算能力。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"游戏与创意应用","id":"游戏与创意应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Unity / Unreal WASM 导出","id":"unity-unreal-wasm-导出"},{"level":2,"text":"音频处理（DSP）","id":"音频处理-dsp"},{"level":2,"text":"物理引擎","id":"物理引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"WebGL 互操作","id":"webgl-互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代码编辑器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/real-world-applications/code-editors"},"next":{"title":"数据与加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/real-world-applications/data-and-crypto"}}